      value: 1.0000017
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5336956100140916112, guid: 86034297a83190f49ab0adafb47440cb,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Whether horizontal, vertical, or floating, Tab Menus are the centerpiece
        of Modern UIs.\n\nThey are designed to serve as the primary interface for
        a VRChat world and can be used for everything from world settings and controls
        to Creator Economy storefronts, whitelist editors, permission managers, notification
        history, and more.\n\n<b>Features</b>\n\n<b>Distance Hiding</b>\n\u2022 Automatically
        hides the UI when players are far away\n\u2022 Helps reduce rendering overhead
        and improve performance\n\n<b>Multi-Page & Section Layouts</b>\n\u2022 Organize
        content across multiple pages and sections\n\u2022 Ideal for settings menus,
        storefronts, moderation tools, and other large interfaces\n\n<b>Multiple
        Locations</b>\n\u2022 Integrates with the Object Mover system\n\u2022 Allows
        the same menu to be repositioned to different locations throughout a world\n\n<b>Spawnable
        Menus</b>\n\u2022 Spawn the menu directly in front of the player\n\u2022
        Supports Desktop, VR, and Mobile users\n\n<b>Main Tab UI Structure</b>\n\nThe
        following hierarchy shows how a typical Tab Menu is structured:\n\n\u2022
        <b>Tab Menu</b>\n    \u2022 The root container that holds the entire UI system\n   
        \u2022 <b>Tab UI</b>\n        \u2022 The buttons or controls used to switch
        between tabs and pages\n    \u2022 <b>Tab Switcher</b>\n        \u2022 Handles
        page switching and manages all available tabs\n        \u2022 <b>Tabs / Pages</b>\n           
        \u2022 Individual pages containing UI content\n            \u2022 <b>Sections</b>\n               
        \u2022 Structured containers used to group related functionality\n               
        \u2022 <b>Elements</b>\n                    \u2022 Interactive components
        such as buttons, toggles, sliders, selectors, text displays, and more"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5757065297534502311, guid: 86034297a83190f49ab0adafb47440cb,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Info
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
